name: a collapsed record is refused rather than stored, which unlearning a profession cannot survive
file: addons/Family/Scanners/Professions.lua
--- old
		entry.recipes = recipes
		entry.recipesSeen = time()
--- new
		if not (was >= 10 and #recipes * 2 < was) then entry.recipes = recipes end
		entry.recipesSeen = time()
